  "body": "Portable Linux x86_64 self-dev build of f04e8d7f480be22baa703440551dc5b79b1bd184.\n\n## Highlights\n\n- Fix todo completion 'finished Xs ago' timestamps freezing at 0s ago by refreshing visible completion ages in place and waking focused redraws at age boundaries.\n- Show last response age in the idle status line after 1 minute.\n- Keep auto-poking partially delivered goals after new completed todo work, and deliver reload-interrupted background task wakes.\n\n## Bundled changes\n\n[View all 1 commit](https://github.com/1jehuang/jcode/compare/4d60d63b6dcb3438592d6fc3d7c3b00ddfcdc24f...f04e8d7f480be22baa703440551dc5b79b1bd184)\n- fix(tui): live-update todo completion 'finished Xs ago' timestamp\n\n<!-- jcode-discord-announced:v1.1.7 -->\n"
